{"strongs": "H1538", "word": "גֻּלְגֹּ֫לֶת", "translit": "gul.go.let", "root": "גלגל", "morph": "H:N-F", "pos": "noun feminine", "gloss": "skull, head, poll", "definition": "גֻּלְגֹּ֫לֶת noun feminine skull, head, poll (person) (on formation compare Ba NB 205 ; Aramaic גּוּלְגַּלְתָּא ) — absolute ׳ ג 2Kgs 9:35 + 3 t.; suffix גֻּלְגָּלְתּוֺ Judg 9:53 ; 1Chr 10:10 plural suffix גֻּלְגְּלֹתָם Num 1:2 + 5 t.; — 1. skull , as broken by a stone Judg 9:53 as severed from body 2Kgs 9:35 ; 1Chr 10:10 . 2. head, poll (in counting, taxing, etc.; only P and late) ׳ עֹמֶר לַגּ Exod 16:16 an omer for every man ; compare Exod 38:26 ; Num 1:2 ; Num 1:18 ; Num 1:20 ; Num 1:22 ; Num 3:47 ; 1Chr 23:3 ; 1Chr 23:24 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1663')\">BDB1663</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H1538')\">H1538</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1662')\">BDB1662</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB1664')\">BDB1664</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>גֻּלְגֹּ֫לֶת</bdbheb> <b>noun feminine</b> <highlightword>skull, head, poll</highlightword> (person) (on formation compare <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Ba')\">Ba<sup>NB 205</sup></lookup>; Aramaic <bdbarc>גּוּלְגַּלְתָּא</bdbarc>) — absolute <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ג</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:35\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,35)\">2Kgs 9:35</ref> + 3 t.; suffix <bdbheb>גֻּלְגָּלְתּוֺ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Judg 9:53\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"53\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"53\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,53)\">Judg 9:53</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 10:10\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(13,10,10)\">1Chr 10:10</ref> plural suffix <bdbheb>גֻּלְגְּלֹתָם</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Num 1:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,2)\">Num 1:2</ref> + 5 t.; — <div class=\"point\"><b>1.</b> <highlight>skull</highlight>, as broken by a stone <ref ref=\"Judg 9:53\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"53\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"53\" onclick=\"bcv(7,9,53)\">Judg 9:53</ref> as severed from body <ref ref=\"2Kgs 9:35\" b=\"12\" cBegin=\"9\" vBegin=\"35\" cEnd=\"9\" vEnd=\"35\" onclick=\"bcv(12,9,35)\">2Kgs 9:35</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 10:10\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"10\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"10\" onclick=\"bcv(13,10,10)\">1Chr 10:10</ref>. </div><div class=\"point\"><b>2.</b> <highlight>head, poll</highlight> (in counting, taxing, etc.; only <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('P')\"><reflink>P</reflink></lookup> and late) <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>עֹמֶר לַגּ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Exod 16:16\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"16\" vBegin=\"16\" cEnd=\"16\" vEnd=\"16\" onclick=\"bcv(2,16,16)\">Exod 16:16</ref> <highlight>an omer for every man</highlight>; compare <ref ref=\"Exod 38:26\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"26\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"26\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,26)\">Exod 38:26</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:2\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,2)\">Num 1:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:18\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,18)\">Num 1:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:20\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"20\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"20\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,20)\">Num 1:20</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 1:22\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"22\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"22\" onclick=\"bcv(4,1,22)\">Num 1:22</ref>; <ref ref=\"Num 3:47\" b=\"4\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"47\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"47\" onclick=\"bcv(4,3,47)\">Num 3:47</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:3\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"3\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"3\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,3)\">1Chr 23:3</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Chr 23:24\" b=\"13\" cBegin=\"23\" vBegin=\"24\" cEnd=\"23\" vEnd=\"24\" onclick=\"bcv(13,23,24)\">1Chr 23:24</ref>. </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "2Kgs 9:35", "book": "2KI", "chapter": 9, "verse": 35}, {"raw": "Judg 9:53", "book": "JDG", "chapter": 9, "verse": 53}, {"raw": "1Chr 10:10", "book": "1CH", "chapter": 10, "verse": 10}, {"raw": "Num 1:2", "book": "NUM", "chapter": 1, "ver